## Requests

Every method takes request options last: `timeout`, `maxRetries`, `headers`, `query`, `body`,
`signal`{% if c.idempotency %} and `idempotencyKey`{% endif %}. Failed requests (connection errors, 408, 409, 429, 5xx)
are retried twice, honouring `Retry-After`.{% if c.idempotency %} Every non-GET request carries an
`{{ c.idempotency }}` header that stays the same across retries.{% endif %}


Call `.withResponse()` on any call to get `{ data, response }`.

Set `{{ c.log_env }}=debug` to log requests; credentials are redacted.
